{"s":[[null,1,[["p",["Wood is a basic resource that can be obtained by felling ",["l","树","Trees"]," and ",["l","农场","branches"]," with an ",["l","斧头","axe"]," or bought from ",["l","罗宾","Robin"]," at the ",["l","木匠的商店","Carpenter's Shop"],". The ",["l","书摊老板","Bookseller"]," trades 100 Wood for 1 ",["l","樵夫周刊","Woodcutter's Weekly"],". Robin sells up to 500 Wood in her ",["l","沙漠节","shop"]," at the ",["l","沙漠节","Desert Festival"]," for 1 Calico Egg ",["l","卡利科三花蛋","Calico Egg"]," each."]],["p",["Wood can also be found in ",["l","钓鱼","Fishing Treasure Chests"],". Ninety-nine Wood can be received as a gift from Robin at the ",["l","冬日星盛宴","Feast of the Winter Star"],". One to 10 Wood can be produced in a ",["l","木跃鱼","Woodskip"]," ",["l","鱼塘","Fish Pond"],", depending on the population of the pond. Wood can additionally be obtained from ",["l","碎木机","chipped"]," ",["l","硬木","Hardwood"]," and from ",["l","回收机","recycled"]," or ",["l","碎木机","chipped"]," ",["l","浮木","Driftwood"],"."]],["p",["Felling a fully grown tree will yield between 12 and 16 Wood. After felling the tree, the stump can be destroyed to yield between 5 and 9 Wood. The amount of Wood dropped will depend on ",["l","运气","Luck"]," and the player's ",["l","采集","Foraging"]," level. Additionally, the ",["l","技能","Forester"]," profession will increase yields from both trees and stumps, while reading ",["l","伐木秘事","Woody's Secret"]," will only increase yields from trees. Felling trees near water can result in the loss of some or all of the Wood. To prevent this, players can destroy the tree while standing on the side where they do not want the tree to fall to, as it will always fall away from them."]]]],["Uses",2,[["p",["Wood can be spent on a variety of different things, including:"]],["l",0,[[1,["Building and upgrading buildings at the ",["l","木匠的商店","Carpenter's Shop"],"."]],[1,[["l","打造","Crafting"]," various items."]],[1,["Creating 1 ",["l","煤炭","coal"]," by placing 10 wood into the ",["l","煤炭窑","Charcoal Kiln"],"."]],[1,["198 Wood are used (in two stacks of 99) in the Crafts Room."]],[1,["300 Wood are used for repairing the ",["l","沙滩","tide pool bridge"]," at the Beach."]],[1,["950 Wood are used for the ",["l","木匠的商店","Community Upgrade"],"."]]]]]],["Purchase Price",2,[["p",["The price of wood at the ",["l","木匠的商店","Carpenter's Shop"]," increases from 10g to 50g starting in Year 2. The player will receive a letter in the mail on Spring 1 of Year 2 saying \"Notice: The price of raw materials at ",["l","木匠的商店","Robin's shop"]," and ",["l","铁匠铺","Clint's shop"]," has increased.\" The gold obtained by selling wood to Robin or through the ",["l","售卖","Shipping Bin"]," is unchanged."]]]],["Crafting",2,[["t",[[{"h":1,"v":["Image"]},{"h":1,"v":["Name"]},{"h":1,"v":["Description"]},{"h":1,"v":["Ingredients"]},{"h":1,"v":["Recipe Source"]}],[[["f","Gate.png",48]],[["l","大门","Gate"]],["Allows you to pass through a fence."],[["i","(O)388","Wood ×10"]],["Starter"]],[[["f","Wood_Fence.png",48]],[["l","木围栏","Wood Fence"]],["Keeps grass and animals contained!"],[["i","(O)388","Wood ×2"]],["Starter"]],[[["f","Wood_Sign.png",48]],[["l","木牌","Wood Sign"]],["Use an item on this to change what's displayed. The item won't be consumed."],[["i","(O)388","Wood ×25"]],["Starter"]],[[["f","Mayonnaise_Machine.png",48]],[["l","蛋黄酱机","Mayonnaise Machine"]],["Turns eggs into mayonnaise."],[["i","(O)388","Wood ×15"],["i","(O)390","Stone ×15"],["i","(O)86","Earth Crystal ×1"],["i","(O)334","Copper Bar ×1"]],[["l","耕种","Farming (Level 2)"]]],[[["f","Bee_House.png",48]],[["l","蜂房","Bee House"]],["Place outside and wait for delicious honey! (Except in Winter)."],[["i","(O)388","Wood ×40"],["i","(O)382","Coal ×8"],["i","(O)335","Iron Bar ×1"],["i","(O)724","Maple Syrup ×1"]],[["l","耕种","Farming (Level 3)"]]],[[["f","Preserves_Jar.png",48]],[["l","罐头瓶","Preserves Jar"]],["Turns vegetables into pickles and fruit into jam."],[["i","(O)388","Wood ×50"],["i","(O)390","Stone ×40"],["i","(O)382","Coal ×8"]]